---
title: role.bodyguard.allow-continuous-protection=false で連続ガードは reject、 襲撃は通る
setup: { bodyguard: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 3 }
rules:
  role.bodyguard.allow-continuous-protection: false
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Alice (狩) が Night 0 と Night 1 で連続して Carol を護衛 → 連続ガード不可、
# Night 1 のガードは reject (guardHistory[1] に entry なし) → Carol 襲撃成立 → Carol 死亡。
# Day 3 で Bob 処刑 → villager_won (狩生存だが Carol 失った)

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=狩人
!Bob=人狼
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人
!Alice 0夜 護衛 Carol
!Alice 1夜 護衛 Carol
!Bob 1夜 襲撃 Carol

# == engine: Night 0 (state.day=1) ==
# peace
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Eve→Dave
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 2 (state.day=2) ==
# Dave 4 / Alice 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 (state.day=3) ==
# 連続ガード reject → Bob 襲撃 Carol 成立 → night_kill Carol
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Bob
Eve→Bob
Bob→Alice

# == engine: Day 3 (state.day=3) ==
# Bob 2 / Alice 1 → execution=Bob → villager_won
# == end ==

# @expect-result: villager_won
# @expect-finished: true
# @expect-status Carol: dead
# @expect-cause Carol: night_kill
